  m_Name: Outcast Renwick
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ScriptableObjects.LieEncounterData
  vendorName: Outcast Renwick
  offerText: Please, take my meager coins and let me hide behind your furniture tonight.
    The street gangs are hunting me down, and I need a safe corner.
  acceptResultText: You take his few coins and let him hide. It cramps your room,
    but saving a man's life gives you a profound sense of peace.
  rejectResultText: You lock the door on him, refusing to bring street trouble into
    your home. You enjoy your clean, quiet room.
  acceptedDelayedText: 
  rejectedDelayedText: The gangs caught Renwick right outside your door! They violently
    smashed your window to interrogate you about him, leaving you badly beaten and
    terrified.
